# UniProt Data Retrieval

This directory contains primary protein sequence entries, functional annotations, and structural cross-references retrieved from the **UniProt Knowledgebase (UniProtKB)**. These datasets serve as foundational inputs for sequence alignment, mutation analysis, domain architecture mapping, and protein feature extraction workflows.

---

## 📂 Directory Overview

```text
Uniprot_Data_Retrieval/
├── P01308/   # Human Insulin (INS)
├── P00519/   # Tyrosine-protein Kinase ABL1 (ABL1)
├── P04637/   # Cellular Tumor Antigen p53 (TP53)
├── P0DTC2/   # SARS-CoV-2 Spike Glycoprotein (S)
└── P68871/   # Human Hemoglobin Subunit Beta (HBB)

```

---

## 🧬 Included UniProt Entries

| UniProt ID | Gene | Protein Name | Organism | Functional Category & Focus |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **`P01308`** | `INS` | Preproinsulin | *Homo sapiens* | **Hormone Processing:** Disulfide connectivity & cleavage site prediction |
| **`P00519`** | `ABL1` | Tyrosine-protein Kinase ABL1 | *Homo sapiens* | **Kinase Signaling:** Active/inactive conformations & targeted drug design |
| **`P04637`** | `TP53` | Cellular Tumor Antigen p53 | *Homo sapiens* | **Tumor Suppressor:** DNA-binding domain mapping & cancer mutation profiling |
| **`P0DTC2`** | `S` | Spike Glycoprotein | *SARS-CoV-2* | **Viral Antigen:** Receptor-binding domain (RBD) & variant analysis |
| **`P68871`** | `HBB` | Hemoglobin Subunit Beta | *Homo sapiens* | **Oxygen Transport:** Hemoglobinopathies & point mutation impacts |

---

## 🛠️ Usage & Purpose

Each subfolder contains FASTA sequence files and metadata annotations retrieved from UniProtKB, suitable for downstream analysis using tools such as:

* **Sequence Alignment & Search:** BLAST, Clustal Omega, MUSCLE
* **Programmatic Parsing:** Biopython (`Bio.ExPASy`, `Bio.SwissProt`), UniProt REST API
* **Domain & Site Annotation:** InterPro, Pfam, PROSITE

